From: Marek Andrzejewski <marek1and@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Read the package version with importlib.metadata

setuptools 82 no longer ships pkg_resources, so importing the extension
fails and Mopidy skips it.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/mopidy_youtube/__init__.py
+++ b/mopidy_youtube/__init__.py
@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@
 import logging
 import pathlib
+from importlib.metadata import version
 
-import pkg_resources
 from mopidy import config, ext
 
-__version__ = pkg_resources.get_distribution("Mopidy-YouTube").version
+__version__ = version("Mopidy-YouTube")
 
 logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)
 
